Package: etvar
Title: Event-Targeted Vector Autoregression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gabor", "Pinter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "gabor.pinter@example.com")
Author: Gabor Pinter [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Gabor Pinter <gabor.pinter@example.com>
Description: Estimates structural vector autoregressive (VAR) models identified
    by targeting one or more event dates. The package finds the orthogonal
    rotation of the Cholesky factor that best explains observed movements on
    the event dates using a single structural shock. It provides tools for
    impulse response analysis, structural forecast error variance
    decomposition, historical decomposition (including counterfactual
    intervention paths), and diagnostic plots.
